{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-research-methods","title":"历史研究方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods","introMarkdown":"# 历史研究方法 简介\n\n历史研究方法是将历史学从业余爱好提升为专业学科的关键，它为历史知识的生产提供系统的操作程序和质量标准。研究生阶段的方法论训练旨在培养独立从事原创性历史研究的能力。\n\n本课程涵盖四个层次递进的章节。第一章**史料学与史源批判**作为历史研究的基石，系统介绍原始史料分析的原则与技巧、档案研究的方法以及数字时代史料批判面临的新挑战，帮助学习者建立对史料的鉴别能力和批判态度。第二章**计量史学方法**引入量化研究工具，探讨历史统计学的基本方法、系列史的分析框架以及历史地理信息系统在空间分析中的应用，展示如何用数据回答传统定性研究难以处理的问题。第三章**质性历史研究**聚焦传记方法、群体传记学和视觉史学方法三种质性研究路径，深入讨论如何通过个体生命叙事、社会群体画像和视觉材料解读把握历史经验的丰富性。第四章**历史写作与呈现**关注研究成果的最终产出形式，从历史叙事写作的技艺到史学史论文的规范，再到公共历史传播的策略，帮助学习者将研究发现转化为有效的历史叙述。\n\n学习建议：带着一个具体的研究问题通读全部章节，思考不同方法如何为该问题提供互补的分析路径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"source-criticism","title":"史料学与史源批判","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/source-criticism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"primary-source-analysis","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 原始史料分析","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/source-criticism/primary-source-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"archival-research","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 档案研究","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/source-criticism/archival-research"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-source-criticism","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 数字史料批判","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/source-criticism/digital-source-criticism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantitative","title":"计量史学方法","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/quantitative","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-statistics","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 历史统计学","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/quantitative/historical-statistics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"serial-history","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 系列史","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/quantitative/serial-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gis-in-history","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 历史GIS","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/quantitative/gis-in-history"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"qualitative","title":"质性历史研究","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/qualitative","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biographical-method","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 传记方法","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/qualitative/biographical-method"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prosopography","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 群体传记学","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/qualitative/prosopography"},{"seq":3,"slug":"visual-history-methods","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 视觉史学方法","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/qualitative/visual-history-methods"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"writing","title":"历史写作与呈现","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-narrative-writing","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 历史叙事写作","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/writing/historical-narrative-writing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historiographical-essay","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 史学史论文写作","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/writing/historiographical-essay"},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-history-communication","title":"研究生 历史研究方法 — 公共历史传播","url":"/education/graduate/history/historical-research-methods/writing/public-history-communication"}]}]}